{"unit_id":"yashua233__dsh-mail-command#card-zh","repo":"yashua233/dsh-mail-command","commit":"b04ceeb86a4a5e90974e7c08585cc9a621a36588","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mail-command 是一个适用于 DSH 的邮件集成插件：它在后台轮询 IMAP 收件箱，并提供 mail_command 工具查看状态或立即检查邮件。邮件中带有会话专属的一次性口令时，回复正文可以继续当前任务、附加新的指令，或停止当前轮次；插件也支持对待审批请求通过邮件回复允许或拒绝。它通过 mailCommand 服务与 dsh-qq-mail-notify 协作，由通知插件发送包含口令的邮件。适合希望离开电脑后通过邮箱回复来推进或中止 DSH 任务的用户。需要配置可用的 IMAP 邮箱账号和授权码；未单独配置时可复用通知插件凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:305-349","lib/index.js:377-395","lib/index.js:446-463","lib/index.js:502-519"]}
{"unit_id":"yashua233__dsh-mail-command#card-en","repo":"yashua233/dsh-mail-command","commit":"b04ceeb86a4a5e90974e7c08585cc9a621a36588","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mail-command lets users continue or stop DSH tasks by replying to notification emails. It polls an IMAP inbox for session tokens and sends reply instructions to the agent. It also handles approval replies and provides a tool to check status or messages. It works with dsh-qq-mail-notify.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:305-349","lib/index.js:377-395","lib/index.js:446-463","lib/index.js:502-519"]}
